WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.825
Let’s walk through Your role in the exercise.

00:00:02.825 --> 00:00:07.200
Use this opening step to establish ownership before learning controls

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:07.375
.

00:00:07.375 --> 00:00:10.562
Identify what this seat creates or reviews, what must

00:00:10.562 --> 00:00:13.750
be handed to another role, and which decisions remain

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:15.463
outside your authority.

00:00:15.463 --> 00:00:18.575
On this slide, as Industry Team Notetaker, you

00:00:18.575 --> 00:00:22.650
preserve the decision process without interrupting Industry Team's flow

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:22.812
.

00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:26.322
In practice, capture evidence that explains how the room

00:00:26.322 --> 00:00:27.285
changed:

00:00:27.285 --> 00:00:30.122
who influenced the choice, where friction emerged, what

00:00:30.122 --> 00:00:33.898
assumptions shifted, and which moment became decisive.

00:00:33.898 --> 00:00:36.648
Before you continue, verify these points:

00:00:36.648 --> 00:00:39.498
Quick captures append to the shared team record.

00:00:39.498 --> 00:00:43.310
Dynamics and alliance notes remain scoped to your notetaker seat

00:00:43.310 --> 00:00:43.460
.

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:47.160
Manual saves publish structured snapshots to the timeline.
